meta {
  name: Register Second User
  type: http
  seq: 4
}

post {
  url: {{authBaseUrl}}/auth/register
  body: json
  auth: none
}

vars:pre-request {
  authBaseUrl: http://localhost:8086
}

body:json {
  {
    "name": "Bruno Tester Two",
    "email": "bruno.tester.2@ecommerce.dev",
    "password": "Bruno@123"
  }
}

docs {
  Second, unrelated regular user — needed only to prove order ownership is enforced
  (see Get Order Forbidden.bru). Hardcodes {{authBaseUrl}} to AuthDirect's port (8086)
  so this works no matter which environment is selected for the rest of the
  order-service-errors folder (auth-service's port never changes between scenarios
  here).

  Expected: 201 CREATED, empty body.
}
